@startuml 02-diagrama-implantacao
title Reforça+: Diagrama de Arquitetura de Implantação (UML Deployment)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2F4F7F
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4E0
}

node "Dispositivo do Usuário\n(smartphone / desktop)" <<device>> as Cliente {
  node "Navegador (Chrome, Edge, Safari)" <<execution environment>> as Browser {
    artifact "Reforça+ PWA\n(HTML, JS, CSS, manifest.json)" as PWAArt
    artifact "Service Worker\n(sw.js)" as SWArt
    database "IndexedDB / Cache Storage\n(dados offline)" as LocalDB
  }
}

cloud "Vercel (Edge Network / CDN)" <<cloud>> as Vercel {
  node "Static Hosting + CDN" <<execution environment>> as Static {
    artifact "build do frontend\n(dist/)" as Dist
  }
}

cloud "Render (Web Service)" <<cloud>> as Render {
  node "Container Docker\n(Node.js 20 LTS)" <<execution environment>> as Cont {
    artifact "reforcamais-api\n(Express)" as API
    artifact "Prisma Client" as Prisma
  }
}

cloud "Neon (PostgreSQL Serverless)" <<cloud>> as Neon {
  database "reforcamais_db\n(PostgreSQL 16)" as PG
}

cloud "Serviços externos" as Ext {
  node "Firebase Cloud Messaging" as FCM
  node "Google OAuth 2.0" as OAuth
}

Browser -down-> Static : HTTPS / GET (assets)
SWArt --> LocalDB : cache e sincronização
PWAArt --> API : HTTPS / REST JSON\n(Bearer JWT)
API --> PG : TLS / PostgreSQL protocol\n(pooler)
Prisma ..> PG
API --> FCM : HTTPS (envio push)
Browser --> OAuth : HTTPS (login)
FCM --> Browser : Web Push

note right of Neon
  Camada gratuita: 0,5 GB,
  branching de banco para
  ambientes de teste.
end note
@enduml
